  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_function_001","statement":"函数 f(x)=(2x+1)/(x-3) 的定义域是？","answer":"x≠3","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"x≠-3","text":"x≠-3"},{"value":"x≠0","text":"x≠0"},{"value":"x≠3","text":"x≠3"},{"value":"x≥3","text":"x≥3"},{"value":"全体实数","text":"全体实数"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_function_domain_fraction","primaryConcept":"alg_functions","concepts":["alg_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["alg_linear_equations"],"skills":["函数定义域"],"patterns":["分母非零"],"misconceptions":["忽略分母限制"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"分式有意义要求分母 x-3 不为 0，所以 x≠3。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一函数基础","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-functions","chapterTitle":"函数客观练习","sequence":28101},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_function_002","statement":"已知 f(x)=x²+1，g(x)=2x-3，则 f(g(2)) 等于多少？","answer":"2","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"0","text":"0"},{"value":"1","text":"1"},{"value":"2","text":"2"},{"value":"4","text":"4"},{"value":"5","text":"5"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_function_composition_value","primaryConcept":"alg_functions","concepts":["alg_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["prealg_substitution"],"skills":["复合函数求值"],"patterns":["先内后外"],"misconceptions":["先计算外函数"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"先求 g(2)=1，再求 f(1)=1²+1=2。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一函数基础","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-functions","chapterTitle":"函数客观练习","sequence":28102},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_function_003","statement":"函数 y=-3x+5 在实数范围内的单调性是什么？","answer":"单调递减","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"单调递增","text":"单调递增"},{"value":"单调递减","text":"单调递减"},{"value":"先增后减","text":"先增后减"},{"value":"先减后增","text":"先减后增"},{"value":"没有单调性","text":"没有单调性"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_function_monotonic_linear","primaryConcept":"alg_functions","concepts":["alg_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["alg_linear_equations"],"skills":["一次函数单调性"],"patterns":["斜率符号"],"misconceptions":["忽略负斜率"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"一次函数 y=kx+b 的斜率 k=-3<0，因此在实数范围内单调递减。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一函数基础","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-functions","chapterTitle":"函数客观练习","sequence":28103},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_quadratic_001","statement":"函数 y=x²-6x+11 的顶点坐标是什么？","answer":"(3,2)","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"(3,-2)","text":"(3,-2)"},{"value":"(-3,2)","text":"(-3,2)"},{"value":"(3,2)","text":"(3,2)"},{"value":"(6,11)","text":"(6,11)"},{"value":"(-6,11)","text":"(-6,11)"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_quadratic_vertex_form","primaryConcept":"alg_quadratics","concepts":["alg_quadratics"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["prealg_simplification"],"skills":["二次函数顶点"],"patterns":["配方"],"misconceptions":["常数项处理错误"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"y=(x-3)²+2，所以顶点为 (3,2)。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一二次函数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-quadratics","chapterTitle":"二次函数客观练习","sequence":28201},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_quadratic_002","statement":"若 x²-2x+k≥0 对一切实数 x 恒成立，k 的取值范围是？","answer":"k≥1","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"k≤1","text":"k≤1"},{"value":"k<1","text":"k<1"},{"value":"k=1","text":"k=1"},{"value":"k≥1","text":"k≥1"},{"value":"k>1","text":"k>1"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_quadratic_inequality_parameter","primaryConcept":"alg_quadratics","concepts":["alg_quadratics"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["alg_linear_equations"],"skills":["二次函数恒非负"],"patterns":["判别式"],"misconceptions":["严格不等号误读"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"判别式 Δ=(-2)²-4k≤0，得 k≥1。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一二次函数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-quadratics","chapterTitle":"二次函数客观练习","sequence":28202},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_quadratic_003","statement":"方程 x²-2x+k=0 有且只有一个实根时，k 等于多少？","answer":"1","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"-1","text":"-1"},{"value":"0","text":"0"},{"value":"1","text":"1"},{"value":"2","text":"2"},{"value":"4","text":"4"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_quadratic_parameter_one_root","primaryConcept":"alg_quadratics","concepts":["alg_quadratics"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["alg_linear_equations"],"skills":["判别式"],"patterns":["重根条件"],"misconceptions":["把两个实根条件当重根"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"有且只有一个实根要求 Δ=4-4k=0，因此 k=1。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一二次函数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-quadratics","chapterTitle":"二次函数客观练习","sequence":28203},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_trig_001","statement":"150° 化为弧度制是多少？","answer":"5π/6","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"π/6","text":"π/6"},{"value":"2π/3","text":"2π/3"},{"value":"5π/6","text":"5π/6"},{"value":"π","text":"π"},{"value":"7π/6","text":"7π/6"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_trig_radian_conversion","primaryConcept":"trig_functions","concepts":["trig_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["arith_fractions"],"skills":["角度弧度转换"],"patterns":["乘以π/180"],"misconceptions":["比例倒置"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"150×π/180=5π/6。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一三角函数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-trigonometry","chapterTitle":"三角函数客观练习","sequence":28301},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_trig_002","statement":"sin30°、cos60°、tan45° 三个值依次是多少？","answer":"1/2,1/2,1","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"1/2,1/2,1","text":"1/2，1/2，1"},{"value":"1/2,√3/2,1","text":"1/2，√3/2，1"},{"value":"√3/2,1/2,1","text":"√3/2，1/2，1"},{"value":"1,1/2,√3","text":"1，1/2，√3"},{"value":"0,1,1","text":"0，1，1"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_trig_special_angle_sin","primaryConcept":"trig_functions","concepts":["trig_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["geo_triangles"],"skills":["特殊角三角函数值"],"patterns":["30-60-90三角形"],"misconceptions":["正余弦对调"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"由特殊角值表，sin30°=1/2，cos60°=1/2，tan45°=1。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一三角函数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-trigonometry","chapterTitle":"三角函数客观练习","sequence":28302},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_trig_003","statement":"sin210° 的值是多少？","answer":"-1/2","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"1/2","text":"1/2"},{"value":"-1/2","text":"-1/2"},{"value":"√3/2","text":"√3/2"},{"value":"-√3/2","text":"-√3/2"},{"value":"1","text":"1"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g10_trig_reference_angle_value","primaryConcept":"trig_unit_circle","concepts":["trig_unit_circle","trig_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["trig_functions"],"skills":["任意角三角函数"],"patterns":["第三象限符号与参考角"],"misconceptions":["象限符号错误"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"210° 的参考角为 30°，第三象限正弦为负，所以 sin210°=-1/2。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高一三角函数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-trigonometry","chapterTitle":"三角函数客观练习","sequence":28303},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_sequence_001","statement":"等差数列首项为3，公差为4，第12项是多少？","answer":"47","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"44","text":"44"},{"value":"47","text":"47"},{"value":"48","text":"48"},{"value":"51","text":"51"},{"value":"52","text":"52"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g11_arithmetic_nth_term","primaryConcept":"alg_functions","concepts":["alg_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["arith_natural_numbers"],"skills":["等差数列通项"],"patterns":["首项加11个公差"],"misconceptions":["误用12个公差"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"a12=3+(12-1)×4=47。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高二数列","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-sequences","chapterTitle":"数列客观练习","sequence":28401},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_sequence_002","statement":"等比数列首项为2，公比为3，第5项是多少？","answer":"162","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"54","text":"54"},{"value":"81","text":"81"},{"value":"108","text":"108"},{"value":"162","text":"162"},{"value":"243","text":"243"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g11_geometric_nth_term","primaryConcept":"alg_functions","concepts":["alg_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["arith_natural_numbers"],"skills":["等比数列通项"],"patterns":["首项乘四次公比"],"misconceptions":["误用五次公比"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"a5=2×3^(5-1)=2×81=162。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高二数列","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-sequences","chapterTitle":"数列客观练习","sequence":28402},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_sequence_003","statement":"等差数列 5，8，11，… 的前20项和是多少？","answer":"670","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"610","text":"610"},{"value":"650","text":"650"},{"value":"670","text":"670"},{"value":"700","text":"700"},{"value":"760","text":"760"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g11_arithmetic_sum","primaryConcept":"alg_functions","concepts":["alg_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["arith_natural_numbers"],"skills":["等差数列求和"],"patterns":["首末项平均乘项数"],"misconceptions":["末项计算错误"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"a20=5+19×3=62，S20=20×(5+62)/2=670。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高二数列","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-sequences","chapterTitle":"数列客观练习","sequence":28403},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_coordinate_001","statement":"过点 A(1,2)、B(5,10) 的直线斜率是多少？","answer":"2","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"1/2","text":"1/2"},{"value":"1","text":"1"},{"value":"2","text":"2"},{"value":"4","text":"4"},{"value":"8","text":"8"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g11_line_slope","primaryConcept":"geo_coordinate_geometry","concepts":["geo_coordinate_geometry"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["alg_linear_equations"],"skills":["直线斜率"],"patterns":["纵坐标差除横坐标差"],"misconceptions":["分子分母颠倒"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"斜率 k=(10-2)/(5-1)=8/4=2。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高二解析几何","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-coordinate","chapterTitle":"解析几何客观练习","sequence":28501},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_coordinate_002","statement":"以 C(2,-1) 为圆心、半径为3的圆的方程是什么？","answer":"(x-2)^2+(y+1)^2=9","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"(x+2)^2+(y-1)^2=9","text":"(x+2)^2+(y-1)^2=9"},{"value":"(x-2)^2+(y+1)^2=9","text":"(x-2)^2+(y+1)^2=9"},{"value":"(x-2)^2+(y-1)^2=3","text":"(x-2)^2+(y-1)^2=3"},{"value":"(x+2)^2+(y+1)^2=9","text":"(x+2)^2+(y+1)^2=9"},{"value":"x^2+y^2=9","text":"x^2+y^2=9"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g11_circle_equation","primaryConcept":"geo_circles","concepts":["geo_circles"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["geo_coordinate_geometry"],"skills":["圆的标准方程"],"patterns":["圆心坐标变号"],"misconceptions":["圆心符号错误"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"圆的方程为 (x-a)^2+(y-b)^2=r^2，代入 a=2、b=-1、r=3 得所示结果。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高二解析几何","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-coordinate","chapterTitle":"解析几何客观练习","sequence":28502},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_coordinate_003","statement":"点 P(1,2) 到直线 3x+4y-10=0 的距离是多少？","answer":"1/5","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"0","text":"0"},{"value":"1/5","text":"1/5"},{"value":"1","text":"1"},{"value":"5","text":"5"},{"value":"9/5","text":"9/5"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g11_point_line_distance","primaryConcept":"geo_coordinate_geometry","concepts":["geo_coordinate_geometry"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["arith_absolute_value"],"skills":["点到直线距离"],"patterns":["距离公式"],"misconceptions":["忘记除以系数平方和开方"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"d=|3×1+4×2-10|/√(3²+4²)=1/5。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高二解析几何","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-coordinate","chapterTitle":"解析几何客观练习","sequence":28503},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_derivative_001","statement":"函数 f(x)=x³-3x²+2 的导函数是什么？","answer":"3x²-6x","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"3x²-3x","text":"3x²-3x"},{"value":"3x²-6x","text":"3x²-6x"},{"value":"x²-6x","text":"x²-6x"},{"value":"3x-6","text":"3x-6"},{"value":"x³-6x","text":"x³-6x"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g12_derivative_power","primaryConcept":"alg_functions","concepts":["alg_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["prealg_expressions"],"skills":["幂函数求导"],"patterns":["幂次乘指数减一"],"misconceptions":["常数项求导错误"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"逐项求导，(x³)'=3x²，(-3x²)'=-6x，常数导数为0。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高三导数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-derivatives","chapterTitle":"导数客观练习","sequence":28601},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_derivative_002","statement":"f(x)=x²+1 的曲线在 x=2 处切线斜率是多少？","answer":"4","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"2","text":"2"},{"value":"3","text":"3"},{"value":"4","text":"4"},{"value":"5","text":"5"},{"value":"8","text":"8"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g12_derivative_tangent_slope","primaryConcept":"alg_functions","concepts":["alg_functions"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["prealg_expressions"],"skills":["导数求切线斜率"],"patterns":["斜率等于函数值导数"],"misconceptions":["误取函数值"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"f'(x)=2x，所以 f'(2)=4，切线斜率为4。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高三导数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-derivatives","chapterTitle":"导数客观练习","sequence":28602},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_derivative_003","statement":"函数 f(x)=x²-4x+1 在区间 [0,3] 上的最小值是多少？","answer":"-3","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"-4","text":"-4"},{"value":"-3","text":"-3"},{"value":"-2","text":"-2"},{"value":"1","text":"1"},{"value":"3","text":"3"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g12_derivative_max_closed_interval","primaryConcept":"alg_quadratics","concepts":["alg_quadratics"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["alg_functions"],"skills":["闭区间最值"],"patterns":["顶点与端点比较"],"misconceptions":["只比较端点"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"配方 f(x)=(x-2)²-3，顶点 x=2 在区间内，故最小值为 -3。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高三导数","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-derivatives","chapterTitle":"导数客观练习","sequence":28603},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_probability_001","statement":"从1到10的整数中随机取一个数，取到偶数或3的倍数的概率是多少？","answer":"7/10","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"1/2","text":"1/2"},{"value":"3/5","text":"3/5"},{"value":"2/3","text":"2/3"},{"value":"7/10","text":"7/10"},{"value":"4/5","text":"4/5"}],"difficulty":3,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g12_probability_classical","primaryConcept":"prob_conditional","concepts":["prob_conditional"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["arith_fractions"],"skills":["古典概型与容斥"],"patterns":["并集计数"],"misconceptions":["重复计算6"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"偶数有5个，3的倍数有3个，交集只有6一个，所以有利数5+3-1=7，概率7/10。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高三概率统计","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-probability","chapterTitle":"概率统计客观练习","sequence":28701},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
  {"id":"cn_senior_auto_v1_probability_002","statement":"袋中有3个红球、2个白球，不放回取两次。已知第一次取到红球，第二次取到红球的概率是多少？","answer":"1/2","answerType":"multiple_choice","choices":[{"value":"1/5","text":"1/5"},{"value":"1/3","text":"1/3"},{"value":"1/2","text":"1/2"},{"value":"3/5","text":"3/5"},{"value":"2/3","text":"2/3"}],"difficulty":2,"source":"cn_senior_auto_v1_adaptation","sourceProblemId":"subjective_v0_zh_g12_probability_conditional","primaryConcept":"prob_conditional","concepts":["prob_conditional"],"prerequisiteConcepts":["arith_fractions"],"skills":["条件概率"],"patterns":["条件后剩余总数"],"misconceptions":["仍用原总数五"],"isAutoGradable":true,"solution":"第一次为红球后剩4个球，其中红球剩2个，所以概率为2/4=1/2。","curriculum":{"course":"CN Senior High Math","theme":"高三概率统计","chapter":"cn-senior-auto-v1-probability","chapterTitle":"概率统计客观练习","sequence":28702},"locale":{"language":"zh-CN","displayTrack":"中文校内","gradeBand":"高中","contentStatus":"reviewed"},"reviewStatus":"reviewed"},
